hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"572","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Quran mein tees ayaton wali ek surat hai; us ne apne padhne wale ke liye sifarish ki yahan tak ke use bakhsh diya gaya; woh surat Surah Al-Mulk hai.'"
"573","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aey logon! Jama ho jao.' Phir Aap hamare paas tashreef laae aur farmaya: 'Main tumhen Quran ka teesra hissa padh kar sunaunga.' Phir Aap ne Surah Al-Ikhlas padhi yahan tak ke use mukammal kiya aur us par izafa nahin kiya. Kisi ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jald main tumhen Quran ka teesra hissa padh kar sunaunga.' Aap ne us par izafa nahin kiya, aur yeh aasman se khabar hai. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) hamare paas tashreef laae aur farmaya: 'Main ne tumhen bataya tha ke jald main tumhen Quran ka teesra hissa padh kar sunaunga, kyunke Surah Al-Ikhlas Quran ke teesre hisse ke barabar hai.'"
"574","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Sab se khair se khali ghar woh hai jo Kitabullah se khali ho.'"
"575","[AI-translation] Is sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai: Aap ne farmaya: 'Jo Quran ki kisi surat ki qasam khae, to agar woh gunahgar ho to us ki har ayat ke badle us par sabr ki qasam hai.'"
"576","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai: Aap ne farmaya: 'Har Musalman doosre Musalman par haraam hai. Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Shaitan us ghar se nikal jata hai jis mein woh Surah Al-Baqarah ki tilawat sunta hai.' Aur Aap ne farmaya: 'Sabr Allah ki taraf se hai, aur jaldi shaitan ki taraf se hai.'"
